  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n\u0131n merkezinde kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131m
    yans\u0131malarda, bir \"hastane\" g\xF6r\xFCyorum. \U0001F3E5\xD6n cephesinde
    g\xF6r\xFCnen \"nab\u0131z \xE7izgisi\" d\xFC\u015F\xFCk ve aral\u0131kl\u0131
    bir kalp at\u0131\u015F\u0131na i\u015Faret ediyor. Bu a\xE7\u0131l\u0131mlar,
    akl\u0131ma eski bir Alman atas\xF6z\xFCn\xFC getirdi {{isim}}. Bu s\xF6z, \"evlilik,
    a\u015Fk\u0131n hastanesidir\" der. Evlili\u011Fini temsil eden hastane fig\xFCr\xFC,
    aran\u0131zdaki romantizmin zamanla azald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131, nabz\u0131n\u0131n
    yava\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 anlat\u0131yor gibi. G\xF6r\xFCn\xFCrde
    p\xFCr\xFCzs\xFCz giden evlili\u011Finde hissetti\u011Fin bu durum, a\xE7\u0131k
    bir yara gibi de\u011Fil de \"g\xF6r\xFCnmez bir yaran\u0131n alt\u0131nda hissetti\u011Fin
    yak\u0131c\u0131 s\u0131z\u0131\" gibi seni i\xE7ten i\xE7e rahats\u0131z etmi\u015F
    anlad\u0131\u011F\u0131m kadar\u0131yla.\n\nLakin yan\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    bir nokta var {{isim}}. E\u015Fin beyefendi, bu mesele hakk\u0131nda senden daha
    fazla endi\u015Fe duyuyor gibi. Bu sebeple {{dogum ayi}} ay\u0131nda g\xF6rebilece\u011Fin,
    \xE7ok b\xFCy\xFCk boyutta bir s\xFCpriz planlad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131, bunu
    senden gizlemek i\xE7in ise b\xFCy\xFCk \xE7aba sarf etti\u011Fini hissediyorum."
